    {
      "id": "claim_f12524dca73446ecb026fe70bac27cb0",
      "statement": "The outer post-commit Git hook runs record-commit-closeout.sh to advance a completed phase and then state-sync.sh push with stdin from /dev/null; Git ignores its exit status so it can never fail the commit.",
